        <note type="editorNote" subtype="footnote" xml:id="IICn_15-1.robnote.fn.12" n="12" source="#robertson"><bibl><biblScope unit="page">180</biblScope></bibl><label>gebycge</label><seg type="original" xml:lang="en"><hi rend="italic">eft gebicge</hi> G.</seg></note>
        <note type="editorNote" subtype="translationFootnote" xml:id="IICn_15-1.whinote.n.9" n="9" source="#whitelock"><bibl><biblScope unit="page">464</biblScope></bibl><label>15.1</label><seg type="original" xml:lang="en">This is largely based on III Edgar 3. The Harley MS. has the significant difference that the penalty has arisen from 120 shillings to the delinquent’s wergild.</seg></note>
